    ex:sourceSummary "Bheema is a 2024 Kannada-language action thriller film directed by Vijay Kumar and produced by Krishna Creations and Jagadeesh Films. The film stars himself alongside Ashwini, Black Dragon Manju, Gili Gili Chandru, Rangayana Raghu, Achyuth Kumar, Gopal Krishna Deshpande and Ramesh Indira. The music was composed by Charan Raj, while the cinematography and editing were handled by Shiva Sena and Deepu S. Kumar." ;
